      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうすると、結局は失敗しちゃったりするの。\r\nだから、無理するのはダメだと思う。",
        "official_en": "But more often than not, I end up worse off for it. So I really think it doesn’t pay to push yourself too hard.",
        "real_en": "When I do that, I often end up failing anyway. So I don't think it's good to push yourself too hard."
